      "body": "EVIDENCE. The product page shows the LG washing machine, the main product price, and the add-to-basket step before the later basket states.\nLEGAL REASONING. This is sequencing evidence, not the standalone infringement screen: it establishes the main product purchase before the paid additional services are automatically added in the following basket frames.\nSTATED LAW. Consumer Contracts Regulations 2013 Regulation 40; DMCC Act 2024 direct consumer-enforcement powers.",
