      "body": "EVIDENCE. The shopping-basket page shows recycling and packaging services selected in the product-services section and added to the order total.\nLEGAL REASONING. The basket state matters because the additional services are already part of the price path unless the consumer opts out; the FIN concludes that this default structure lacks express consent for additional payments.\nSTATED LAW. Consumer Contracts Regulations 2013 Regulation 40; DMCC Act 2024 direct consumer-enforcement powers.",
